    "body": "TWatch 1.1.46 complete core provisioning\n\nHome SHA256 f376d722b07c52184cf4cd27df306054920cdf742ccb8bdd4d476a08e35aef54. Runtime 0.4.11; ESP-IDF 6.1; GCC 15.2.\nComplete125-file/61-ELF internal store and credential-free boot_profiles.core feed.\nThe separate dynamic apps list is empty; the bootstrap inventory is complete.\nSettings, Springboard and58 retained ELFs remain byte-identical to1.1.43.\nCompared with 1.1.45, 122 of 125 store files and 60 of 61 ELFs are unchanged; only Home ELF, Home version manifest and native cohort identity differ.\nHome 0.20.1 matches Waveshare 0.1.59 exactly, with native sleep transactions, confirmation deferral and first-exit checkpoint.\nThe lossless atlas codec preserves decoded pixels and uses256 additional stack bytes per decode.\nRTEF1 serial file namespace2 remains private AppData, never the boot bank.\nSoftware-qualified; hardware first-start/profile acceptance has not been tested.\nFactory image ERASES existing data. Back up first. No preserving update kit is supplied.\nThe1.1.43 preserving transition is rejected because Home gains already-owned namespace6 without migration authority.\nDo not flash firmware/store files independently; their native identity and bank binding must remain paired.\n",
